AI BROKER APP (Commodities, Cripto, Acciones)

## 📋 ESPECIFICACIONES GENERALES INTEGRADAS
- **Mercados:** Commodities (oro, petróleo, etc.), Criptomonedas (usando glosario Prompt 1 + conceptos Prompt 2 + estrategias Prompt 3), Acciones (integración universal: S&P500, Nasdaq via APIs).
- **Idiomas:** Español (ES), Inglés (EN), Francés (FR) – Detectar auto via browser, toggle en UI.
- **Datos de Entrenamiento IA (EMBEDDED):** 
  - **Prompt 1:** Glosario completo (A-Z: 250+ términos crypto/blockchain/DeFi en ES).
  - **Prompt 2:** Conceptos avanzados (Trading algorítmico: Pine/EMA/RSI/TWAP/POV; Derivados/Greek; Escalabilidad: Rollups/SegWit/Taproot; Cripto: TSS/ZKP/BFT; Blockchain×IA).
  - **Prompt 3:** Estrategias inversión (HODL/DCA/Staking/DeFi/Arbitraje; Diversificación 70/30; RSI/Bollinger; Riesgos: Rug Pulls/Pump-Dump; DYOR).
  - **Universal:** Commodities (contango/backwardation, contratos futuros); Stocks (ETFs, AUM, NAV); News sentiment (FUD/FOMO, Crypto Fear&Greed); APIs: NewsAPI.org (news), AlphaVantage/CoinGecko/YahooFinance (precios reales), CryptoFearGreedIndex API.
- **Lógica IA:** Embed en LLM (e.g., Grok/GPT via API) o local (Ollama/Llama3). Ponderar: Tiempo input → Horizonte (corto: trading/arbitraje; largo: HODL/staking). Prioridad (Fast: alta volatilidad/DeFi/vol; Stability: PoS/blue-chips/ETFs). Tipo (Crypto/Commodities/Stocks/General). Layer extra: News sentiment (e.g., +ve news → boost alcistas). Output: Top 5 predicciones (e.g., "BTC ETF", "Oro futuros", "AAPL stock") con pros/cons concisos (#1DF096/#B90A05), tiempo retiro óptimo (basado en RSI/EMA/backtest simulado).
- **UI/UX:** Bordes afilados (no rounded), blur/gradientes diagonales (#F9FAF6→#82EAFF→#F31B80→#7711AA), bg #242325, luxe minimalista (diagonales sutiles, sombras blur 20px, tipografía sans-serif bold italic). Responsive (mobile-first).

## 🔧 TECH STACK
| Capa | Tecnologías |
|------|-------------|
| **Frontend** | React/Next.js + TailwindCSS + Framer Motion (anims diagonales) + i18next (multilang) |
| **Backend/IA** | Node.js/Express + LangChain (embed knowledge base) + Ollama (local LLM) o OpenAI API |
| **Datos Realtime** | WebSockets (prices/news), Axios (APIs: CoinGecko, AlphaVantage gratis tier, NewsAPI keyless) |
| **Deploy** | Vercel/Netlify (frontend), Railway/Render (backend), Docker para local |

## 🧬 SECUENCIA DE DESARROLLO (Ejecutar paso a paso)

### 1. **Setup Proyecto (5 min)**
```bash
npx create-next-app@latest ai-broker --ts --tailwind --eslint --app
cd ai-broker
npm i framer-motion i18next react-i18next axios langchain @langchain/community ollama ws crypto-js
npm i -D @types/node
```
- Crea `knowledge-base.json`: Copia JSON de Prompts 1-3 + universal (e.g., `{glossary: [...], strategies: [...], concepts: [...]}`).

### 2. **Backend: Servidor IA + APIs (15 min)**
```js
// pages/api/predict.js (Next.js API Route)
import { OllamaEmbeddings } from "@langchain/community/embeddings/ollama";
import { Ollama } from "@langchain/community/llms/ollama";
import axios from "axios";
import knowledgeBase from "../../knowledge-base.json"; // Embed prompts 1-3 + universal

const llm = new Ollama({ model: "llama3.1", baseUrl: "http://localhost:11434" });
const embeddings = new OllamaEmbeddings({ model: "nomic-embed-text" });

export default async function handler(req, res) {
  const { timeH, timeD, timeW, timeM, timeY, priority, type, lang } = req.body; // Inputs
  const totalTime = timeH*1 + timeD*24 + timeW*168 + timeM*720 + timeY*8760; // Hours total
  const horizon = totalTime < 168 ? "short" : totalTime < 8760 ? "medium" : "long";

  // News layer
  const news = await axios.get("https://newsapi.org/v2/everything?q=crypto+stocks+commodities&apiKey=YOUR_KEY");
  const sentiment = news.data.articles.slice(0,10).map(a => a.title).join(". "); // FUD/FOMO parse

  // Prompt IA con knowledge
  const fullPrompt = `
  Usa este conocimiento: ${JSON.stringify(knowledgeBase)}.
  Usuario: Horizonte ${horizon}h (${priority}: fast-earnings/stability), tipo ${type || "general"}.
  News: ${sentiment}.
  Predice TOP 5 inversiones (crypto/commodities/stocks). Para cada: nombre genérico (e.g. "BTC-like PoW", "Oro spot", "Tech ETF"), pros/cons concisos, retiro óptimo.
  Estrategias: ${priority==="fast" ? "Arbitraje/DeFi/Trading" : "HODL/DCA/Staking"}. Riesgos DYOR.
  Output JSON: [{name, pros:["+pt1 (#1DF096)"], cons:["-pt1 (#B90A05)"], withdraw:"X días"}]`;

  const result = await llm.call(fullPrompt);
  res.json(JSON.parse(result)); // Parse safe
}
```
- Corre Ollama: `ollama run llama3.1` + `ollama pull nomic-embed-text`.
- Embed knowledge: Indexa en vector store (LangChain).

### 3. **Frontend: UI Minimalista Luxe (20 min)**
```tsx
// app/page.tsx
"use client";
import { useState } from "react";
import { motion, AnimatePresence } from "framer-motion";
import { useTranslation } from "react-i18next"; // i18n setup abajo

export default function Home() {
  const { t, i18n } = useTranslation();
  const [time, setTime] = useState({h:0,d:0,w:0,m:0,y:0});
  const [priority, setPriority] = useState("stability"); // "fast" | "stability"
  const [type, setType] = useState("general");
  const [predictions, setPredictions] = useState([]);
  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(false);

  const submit = async () => {
    setLoading(true);
    const res = await fetch("/api/predict", {
      method: "POST",
      body: JSON.stringify({ ...time, priority, type, lang: i18n.language }),
    });
    setPredictions(await res.json());
    setLoading(false);
  };

  return (
    <div className="min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-br from-[#242325] to-[#1a1a1b] backdrop-blur-xl p-8 font-sans text-[#F9FAF6] overflow-hidden">
      {/* Header Lang Toggle */}
      <div className="flex justify-end mb-8">
        <select onChange={(e) => i18n.changeLanguage(e.target.value)} className="bg-[#242325]/50 border border-[#F31B80] text-[#82EAFF] px-4 py-2 sharp-edge">
          <option value="es">ES</option><option value="en">EN</option><option value="fr">FR</option>
        </select>
      </div>

      {/* Diagonal Gradient Overlay */}
      <motion.div className="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-tr from-[#7711AA]/20 via-[#F31B80]/10 to-[#82EAFF]/5 rotate-[-10deg] blur-xl" animate={{ rotate: [-10, -12] }} transition={{ duration: 20, repeat: Infinity }} />

      {/* Inputs */}
      <div className="max-w-2xl mx-auto space-y-8">
        <h1 className="text-5xl font-bold bg-gradient-to-r from-[#F9FAF6] to-[#82EAFF] bg-clip-text text-transparent drop-shadow-lg">{t("title")}</h1>

        {/* Time Inputs */}
        <div className="grid grid-cols-5 gap-4 bg-[#242325]/50 backdrop-blur-md p-6 border border-[#F31B80]/30 sharp-edge">
          {["h","d","w","m","y"].map(u => (
            <input key={u} type="number" min={0} placeholder={t(u)} onChange={e => setTime({...time, [u]: +e.target.value})}
              className="bg-transparent border-0 border-b-2 border-[#82EAFF]/50 text-[#F9FAF6] text-center py-4 focus:border-[#F31B80] sharp-edge focus:outline-none" />
          ))}
        </div>

        {/* Priority Slider */}
        <div className="bg-[#242325]/50 backdrop-blur p-6 border border-[#7711AA]/30 sharp-edge">
          <label>{t("priority")}</label>
          <input type="range" min={0} max={100} value={priority==="fast"?100:0} onChange={e => setPriority(e.target.value>50?"fast":"stability")}
            className="w-full h-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#B90A05] to-[#1DF096] rounded-none sharp-edge accent-[#F31B80]" />
          <div className="flex justify-between text-xs mt-2 text-[#82EAFF]">{t("stability")} ↔ {t("fast")}</div>
        </div>

        {/* Type Select */}
        <select value={type} onChange={e => setType(e.target.value)} className="w-full bg-[#242325]/50 border border-[#F31B80] text-[#F9FAF6] p-6 sharp-edge">
          <option value="general">{t("general")}</option>
          <option value="crypto">{t("crypto")}</option>
          <option value="stocks">{t("stocks")}</option>
          <option value="commodities">{t("commodities")}</option>
        </select>

        <motion.button onClick={submit} className="w-full py-6 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#F31B80] to-[#7711AA] text-[#F9FAF6] font-bold sharp-edge hover:blur-sm hover:scale-[1.02] shadow-[0_10px_30px_rgba(243,27,128,0.4)]" whileHover={{ scale: 1.05 }}>
          {loading ? t("loading") : t("predict")}
        </motion.button>
      </div>

      {/* Outputs */}
      <AnimatePresence>
        {predictions.map((pred, i) => (
          <motion.div key={i} initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 50 }} animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }} className="max-w-2xl mx-auto mt-12 bg-[#242325]/70 backdrop-blur-xl p-8 border border-[#82EAFF]/30 sharp-edge shadow-2xl">
            <h3 className="text-2xl font-bold bg-gradient-to-r from-[#1DF096] to-[#82EAFF] bg-clip-text">{pred.name}</h3>
            <div className="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-6 text-sm">
              <div>
                <h4 className="text-[#1DF096] font-bold mb-2">{t("pros")}</h4>
                <ul className="space-y-1">{pred.pros.map((p,j) => <li key={j}>• {p}</li>)}</ul>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 className="text-[#B90A05] font-bold mb-2">{t("cons")}</h4>
                <ul className="space-y-1">{pred.cons.map((c,j) => <li key={j}>• {c}</li>)}</ul>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div className="mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-[#F31B80]/50 text-center text-[#82EAFF] font-bold">
              {t("withdraw")}: {pred.withdraw}
            </div>
          </motion.div>
        ))}
      </AnimatePresence>
    </div>
  );
}
```

### 4. **i18n Setup (3 min)**
```js
// i18n.js
import i18n from 'i18next';
import { initReactI18next } from 'react-i18next';

i18n.use(initReactI18next).init({
  resources: {
    es: { translation: { title: "AI Broker", priority: "Prioridad: Estabilidad ↔ Ganancias Rápidas", /* + todos keys de UI, glosario para tooltips */ } },
    en: { translation: { title: "AI Broker", /* mirror */ } },
    fr: { translation: { title: "AI Broker", /* mirror */ } }
  },
  lng: "es",
  fallbackLng: "en"
});
```
- Integra glosario Prompt 1 como tooltips hover (e.g., RSI: def de glosario).

### 5. **News/Prices Realtime (5 min)**
- Agrega WebSocket en `/api/news-ws.js`: Stream precios/news cada 30s, feed a IA para sentiment live.

### 6. **Test & Deploy (5 min)**
```bash
npm run dev  # Local: http://localhost:3000
vercel --prod  # Deploy
```
- Test: Input 1w fast crypto → Outputs como "PoW Asset" (pros: Halving yield #1DF096), retiro "72h post-news pump".

### 7. **Optimizaciones Finales**
- **Blur/Gradientes Diagonales:** Tailwind `bg-gradient-to-[135deg]` + `filter blur(1rem)`.
- **Sharp Edges:** `rounded-none` everywhere.
- **IA Precision:** Fine-tune con backtesting sim (Prompt 2: RSI/EMA logic).
- **Seguridad:** Rate-limit API, no real trades (simulador).

