                                 onClick={() => setIsAutoRiskStandard(!isAutoRiskStandard)} 
                                 className={`px-2 py-0.5 border text-[7px] transition-all sharp-edge font-sans ${isAutoRiskStandard ? 'bg-broker-green border-broker-green text-black' : 'border-white/10 text-gray-500'}`}
                               >
                                 {t.autoRisk}
                               </button>
                             </div>
                             <input 
                               type="range" 
                               disabled={isAutoRiskStandard} 
                               min="0" max="100" 
                               value={riskScore} 
                               onChange={(e) => setRiskScore(parseInt(e.target.value))} 
                               className={`w-full h-1 appearance-none ${isAutoRiskStandard ? 'bg-broker-cyan shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(130,234,255,0.5)] cursor-default' : 'bg-white/10 accent-broker-pink cursor-pointer'}`} 
                             />
                          </div>
                        ) : (
                          <div className={`space-y-2 border-t border-white/5 pt-3 transition-all ${isComboMode ? 'opacity-100' : 'opacity-0'}`}>
                            <p className="text-[7px] font-black text-broker-cyan uppercase tracking-tighter">QUANTUM COMBO // MASTER RISK PROFILE</p>
                            <div className="bg-black/40 border border-broker-cyan/20 p-3 sharp-edge flex flex-col gap-3 relative overflow-hidden group">
                               <div className="flex justify-between items-center text-[8px] font-black font-sans relative z-10">
                                 <button 
                                    onClick={() => setIsComboAuto(!isComboAuto)} 
                                    className={`px-2 py-1 border transition-all ${isComboAuto ? 'border-broker-green text-broker-green bg-broker-green/10' : 'border-white/10 text-gray-500'}`}
                                  >
                                    STRATEGY {isComboAuto ? 'AUTO' : 'MANUAL'}
                                  </button>
                                 <span className={isComboAuto ? 'text-broker-green' : 'text-broker-pink'}><span className="num-font font-mono">{isComboAuto ? 'OPTIMAL' : comboRisk + '%'}</span></span>
                               </div>
                               <input 
                                  type="range" 
                                  disabled={isComboAuto} 
                                  min="0" max="100" 
                                  value={comboRisk} 
                                  onChange={(e) => setComboRisk(parseInt(e.target.value))} 
                                  className={`w-full h-1 relative z-10 appearance-none transition-all ${isComboAuto ? 'bg-broker-green shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(29,240,150,0.5)]' : 'bg-white/10 accent-broker-pink'}`} 
                                />
                            </div>
                          </div>
                        )}
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </motion.aside>
            )}
          </AnimatePresence>

          {/* Main Workspace */}
          <section className="flex-grow flex flex-col gap-5 min-w-0">
            <div className="bg-[#242325] border border-white/10 shadow-xl overflow-hidden sharp-edge">
              <div className="flex border-b border-white/5">
                {[
                  { id: 'predict', icon: <Command size={12}/>, label: t.tabPredictor },
                  { id: 'search', icon: <Search size={12}/>, label: t.tabSearch },
                ].map(tab => (
                  <button
                    key={tab.id}
                    disabled={loading}
                    onClick={() => setViewMode(tab.id as any)}
                    className={`flex-1 py-3 text-[9px] font-black tracking-widest uppercase flex items-center justify-center gap-2 transition-all font-sans disabled:opacity-50 ${viewMode === tab.id ? 'bg-[#1A1A1C] text-white border-b-2 border-broker-cyan' : 'bg-transparent text-gray-600 hover:text-white'}`}
                  >
                    {tab.icon} {tab.label}
                  </button>
                ))}
              </div>

              <div className="p-4">
                {viewMode === 'predict' ? (
                  <motion.button 
                    onClick={handleExecute} 
                    disabled={loading} 
                    animate={!loading ? { scale: [1, 1.01, 1] } : {}}
                    transition={{ repeat: Infinity, duration: 4 }}
                    className="w-full py-4 bg-white text-black font-black text-base tracking-[0.2em] sharp-edge hover:bg-broker-cyan transition-all disabled:opacity-50 flex justify-center items-center gap-4 group font-sans"
                  >
                    {loading ? <Activity size={20} className="animate-spin" /> : <ArrowRight size={20} className="group-hover:translate-x-2 transition-transform" />}
                    {loading ? t.loading : t.predict}
                  </motion.button>
                ) : (
                  <div className="flex gap-2">
                    <input 
                      disabled={loading}
                      type="text" 
                      value={searchQuery} 
                      onChange={(e) => setSearchQuery(e.target.value)} 
                      onKeyDown={(e) => e.key === 'Enter' && handleSearch()} 
                      placeholder={t.searchPlaceholder} 
                      className="flex-grow bg-white/5 border border-white/10 p-3 text-[11px] font-sans outline-none focus:border-broker-cyan/50 sharp-edge text-white transition-all disabled:opacity-50" 
                    />
                    <button 
                      onClick={handleSearch} 
                      disabled={loading} 
                      className="px-6 bg-broker-cyan text-black font-black tracking-widest text-[9px] uppercase sharp-edge hover:bg-white transition-all disabled:opacity-50 font-sans"
                    >
                      {t.searchButton}
                    </button>
                  </div>
                )}
              </div>
            </div>

            <div className="space-y-4">
              <AnimatePresence mode="popLayout">
                {(viewMode === 'predict' ? predictorResults : searchResults).filter(p => (p.confidence || 0) >= 75).map((pred, idx) => (
                  <PredictionCard key={idx} data={pred} t={t} index={idx} loading={loading} />
                ))}
              </AnimatePresence>

              {(viewMode === 'predict' ? predictorResults : searchResults).filter(p => (p.confidence || 0) >= 75).length === 0 && !loading && (
                <motion.div initial={{ opacity: 0 }} animate={{ opacity: 1 }} className="py-16 text-center border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.01] sharp-edge">
                  <LayoutDashboard size={40} className="mx-auto mb-3 text-gray-800" />
                  <p className="text-[9px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-gray-700 font-sans">
                    {viewMode === 'predict' ? 'QUANTUM ORACLE IDLE' : 'SCANNER SYSTEM READY'}
                  </p>
                  <p className="text-[7px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-800 mt-1 font-sans">
                    {viewMode === 'predict' ? 'AWAITING SYSTEM PARAMETERS' : 'ENTER GLOBAL SYMBOL TO START'}
                  </p>
                </motion.div>
              )}
            </div>
          </section>
        </main>
      </div>

      <AnimatePresence>
        {loading && (
          <motion.div initial={{ opacity: 0 }} animate={{ opacity: 1 }} exit={{ opacity: 0 }} className="fixed top-0 left-0 w-full h-[2px] z-[60] bg-broker-cyan/10">
            <motion.div 
              initial={{ width: '0%' }} 
              animate={{ width: '100%' }} 
              transition={{ repeat: Infinity, duration: 1.5, ease: "linear" }}
              className="h-full bg-broker-cyan shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(130,234,255,0.8)]"
            />
          </motion.div>
        )}
      </AnimatePresence>

      <Dictionary />
    </div>
  );
}

import React, { useState, useCallback, useMemo, useEffect } from 'react';
import { motion, AnimatePresence } from 'framer-motion';
import { TRANSLATIONS } from './constants';
import { Language, MarketType, Prediction, TimeInput, HorizonMode, ComboAssetConfig } from './types';
import { fetchPredictions, searchAssets, fetchLiveMarketData } from './services/geminiService';
import PredictionCard from './components/PredictionCard';
import Dictionary from './components/Dictionary';
import { Activity, Globe, Wallet, Clock, Filter, Search, ShieldCheck, X, Command, Cpu, ArrowRight, Settings, LayoutDashboard } from 'lucide-react';

const MotionDiv = motion.div as any;

export default function App() {
  const [lang, setLang] = useState<Language>('es');
  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(false);
  const [error, setError] = useState<string | null>(null);

  const [predictorResults, setPredictorResults] = useState<Prediction[]>([]);
  const [searchResults, setSearchResults] = useState<Prediction[]>([]);
  const [viewMode, setViewMode] = useState<'predict' | 'search'>('predict');
  const [searchQuery, setSearchQuery] = useState('');

  const [budget, setBudget] = useState<number | null>(null);

  // Master risk for COMBO mode
  const [comboRisk, setComboRisk] = useState(50);
  const [isComboAuto, setIsComboAuto] = useState(true);

  const [horizonMode, setHorizonMode] = useState<HorizonMode>('precise');
  const [time, setTime] = useState<TimeInput>({ h: 0, d: 24, w: 0, m: 0, y: 0 });
  const [dates, setDates] = useState({ 
    start: new Date().toISOString().split('T')[0], 
    end: new Date(Date.now() + 7 * 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000).toISOString().split('T')[0] 
  });

  const [riskScore, setRiskScore] = useState(50);
  const [isAutoRiskStandard, setIsAutoRiskStandard] = useState(true);
  const [type, setType] = useState<MarketType>(MarketType.GENERAL);

  const t = TRANSLATIONS[lang];
  const isComboMode = type === MarketType.COMBO;

  const sortedMarketTypes = useMemo(() => {
    return Object.values(MarketType).sort((a, b) => {
      const labelA = (t[a as keyof typeof t] || a).toUpperCase();
      const labelB = (t[b as keyof typeof t] || b).toUpperCase();
      return labelA.localeCompare(labelB, lang);
    });
  }, [t, lang]);

  const totalHours = useMemo(() => {
    if (horizonMode === 'precise') {
      return (time.h * 1) + (time.d * 24) + (time.w * 168) + (time.m * 720) + (time.y * 8760);
    } else {
      const s = new Date(dates.start);
      const e = new Date(dates.end);
      const diff = e.getTime() - s.getTime();
      return Math.max(0, Math.floor(diff / (1000 * 60 * 60)));
    }
  }, [time, dates, horizonMode]);

  const autoRiskCalculated = useMemo(() => {
    if (totalHours <= 24) return 85; 
    if (totalHours <= 168) return 65; 
    if (totalHours <= 720) return 50; 
    if (totalHours <= 4320) return 30; 
    return 15; 
  }, [totalHours]);

  // Sync both risk systems with the auto calculator
  useEffect(() => {
    if (isAutoRiskStandard) {
      setRiskScore(autoRiskCalculated);
    }
    if (isComboAuto) {
      setComboRisk(autoRiskCalculated);
    }
  }, [autoRiskCalculated, isAutoRiskStandard, isComboAuto]);

  const handleExecute = useCallback(async () => {
    setLoading(true);
    setError(null);
    try {
      const tickerData = await fetchLiveMarketData();
      const context = Array.isArray(tickerData) ? tickerData.map(i => `${i.symbol}: ${i.price}`).join(', ') : '';

      const mappedComboSettings = [
        { risk: comboRisk, isAuto: isComboAuto, type: MarketType.GENERAL },
        { risk: comboRisk, isAuto: isComboAuto, type: MarketType.GENERAL },
        { risk: comboRisk, isAuto: isComboAuto, type: MarketType.GENERAL }
      ];

      const results = await fetchPredictions(
        totalHours || 24, 
        isAutoRiskStandard ? 'AUTO' : riskScore, 
        type, 
        lang, 
        budget, 
        isComboMode ? mappedComboSettings : null, 
        context
      );
      setPredictorResults(Array.isArray(results) ? results : []);
    } catch (err: any) {
      setError(err?.message || 'Execution failed');
    } finally { setLoading(false); }
  }, [totalHours, riskScore, isAutoRiskStandard, type, lang, budget, isComboMode, comboRisk, isComboAuto]);

  const handleSearch = async () => {
    if (!searchQuery.trim()) return;
    setLoading(true);
    setError(null);
    try {
      const results = await searchAssets(`${searchQuery}`, lang);
      setSearchResults(Array.isArray(results) ? results : []);
    } catch (err: any) {
      setError('Search Error');
    } finally { setLoading(false); }
  };

  return (
    <div className="min-h-screen relative font-sans text-broker-text bg-[#141415] selection:bg-broker-pink selection:text-white overflow-x-hidden">
      <div className="relative z-10 flex flex-col min-h-screen">
        <header className="px-6 py-3 flex justify-between items-center max-w-full mx-auto w-full border-b border-white/5 bg-[#141415]/80 backdrop-blur-md sticky top-0 z-50">
          <motion.div initial={{ opacity: 0, x: -20 }} animate={{ opacity: 1, x: 0 }} className="flex items-center gap-3">
            <Cpu size={20} className="text-broker-cyan" />
            <h1 className="text-lg font-black italic tracking-tight uppercase text-white font-sans">
              {t.title} <span className="text-[9px] text-gray-500 font-black tracking-[0.2em] ml-3 hidden sm:inline">V5.1 QUANTUM SIDEBAR</span>
            </h1>
          </motion.div>

          <div className="flex items-center gap-4">
             <div className="flex items-center gap-2 bg-white/5 px-3 py-1 sharp-edge border border-white/5">
                <Globe size={12} className="text-broker-cyan" />
                <select 
                  disabled={loading}
                  value={lang} 
                  onChange={(e) => setLang(e.target.value as Language)} 
                  className="bg-transparent text-[9px] font-black uppercase outline-none cursor-pointer font-sans disabled:opacity-50"
                >
                  <option value="es" className="bg-[#141415]">ES</option>
                  <option value="en" className="bg-[#141415]">EN</option>
                  <option value="fr" className="bg-[#141415]">FR</option>
                </select>
             </div>
          </div>
        </header>

        <main className="flex-grow p-4 lg:px-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 max-w-[1440px] mx-auto w-full">

          <AnimatePresence mode="wait">
            {viewMode === 'predict' && (
              <motion.aside 
                initial={{ opacity: 0, x: -30 }}
                animate={{ opacity: 1, x: 0 }}
                exit={{ opacity: 0, x: -30 }}
                className={`md:w-[300px] flex-shrink-0 space-y-5 transition-opacity duration-300 ${loading ? 'opacity-60 pointer-events-none' : ''}`}
              >
                <div className={`bg-[#242325] border border-white/10 sharp-edge p-5 shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden transition-all duration-700 ${isComboMode ? 'shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(130,234,255,0.2)] border-broker-cyan/50' : ''}`}>
                  <div className={`absolute top-0 left-0 w-1 h-full transition-colors duration-500 ${isComboMode ? 'bg-broker-cyan animate-pulse' : 'bg-broker-cyan'}`} />

                  {isComboMode && (
                    <motion.div 
                      animate={{ opacity: [0.05, 0.15, 0.05] }}
                      transition={{ repeat: Infinity, duration: 4 }}
                      className="absolute inset-0 bg-broker-cyan/5 pointer-events-none"
                    />
                  )}

                  <div className="space-y-6 relative z-10">
                    <div className="space-y-3">
                      <div className="flex justify-between items-center">
                        <span className="text-[9px] font-black tracking-widest text-broker-cyan uppercase flex items-center gap-2 font-sans">
                          <Clock size={12} /> {t.horizon}
                        </span>
                        <button 
                          onClick={() => setHorizonMode(horizonMode === 'precise' ? 'calendar' : 'precise')} 
                          className="text-[7px] font-black px-1.5 py-0.5 text-gray-500 hover:text-white border border-white/10 sharp-edge transition-all font-sans"
                        >
                          {horizonMode === 'precise' ? t.calendar : t.precise}
                        </button>
                      </div>
                      {horizonMode === 'precise' ? (
                        <div className="grid grid-cols-5 gap-1">
                          {['h', 'd', 'w', 'm', 'y'].map((k) => (
                            <div key={k} className="flex flex-col gap-1">
                              <span className="text-[7px] text-center font-black text-gray-700 uppercase font-sans">{k}</span>
                              <input 
                                type="number" 
                                value={(time as any)[k] || ''} 
                                onChange={(e) => setTime({...time, [k]: parseInt(e.target.value) || 0})} 
                                className="bg-white/5 border border-white/5 p-1.5 text-center text-[9px] font-mono num-font outline-none focus:border-broker-pink/50 sharp-edge text-white transition-all shimmer-focus" 
                              />
                            </div>
                          ))}
                        </div>
                      ) : (
                        <div className="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2">
                          <div className="flex flex-col gap-1">
                            <span className="text-[7px] font-black text-gray-700 uppercase font-sans">{t.startDate}</span>
                            <input type="date" value={dates.start} onChange={(e) => setDates({...dates, start: e.target.value})} className="bg-white/5 border border-white/5 p-1.5 text-[9px] font-mono num-font outline-none focus:border-broker-pink/50 sharp-edge text-white transition-all" />
                          </div>
                          <div className="flex flex-col gap-1">
                            <span className="text-[7px] font-black text-gray-700 uppercase font-sans">{t.endDate}</span>
                            <input type="date" value={dates.end} onChange={(e) => setDates({...dates, end: e.target.value})} className="bg-white/5 border border-white/5 p-1.5 text-[9px] font-mono num-font outline-none focus:border-broker-pink/50 sharp-edge text-white transition-all" />
                          </div>
                        </div>
                      )}
                    </div>

                    <div className="space-y-2">
                      <span className="text-[9px] font-black tracking-widest text-broker-green uppercase flex items-center gap-2 font-sans">
                        <Wallet size={12} /> {t.budgetLabel}
                      </span>
                      <div className="flex items-center gap-2 bg-white/5 px-3 py-2 sharp-edge border border-white/5 focus-within:border-broker-green/50 transition-all">
                        <span className="text-[10px] font-mono text-broker-green">$</span>
                        <input 
                          type="number" 
                          value={budget || ''}
                          onChange={(e) => setBudget(parseFloat(e.target.value) || null)}
                          placeholder={t.budgetPlaceholder}
                          className="bg-transparent text-[11px] font-mono num-font outline-none w-full text-white placeholder:text-gray-700"
                        />
                      </div>
                    </div>

                    <div className="space-y-3">
                      <span className="text-[9px] font-black tracking-widest text-broker-cyan uppercase flex items-center gap-2 font-sans">
                        <Filter size={12}/> {t.strategy}
                      </span>
                      <div className="space-y-3">
                        <div className="flex flex-col gap-1.5">
                           <span className="text-[7px] font-black text-gray-700 uppercase font-sans">{t.priority}</span>
                           <select 
                              value={type} 
                              onChange={(e) => setType(e.target.value as MarketType)} 
                              className={`w-full bg-black/40 border p-2 text-[9px] font-sans uppercase outline-none cursor-pointer sharp-edge transition-all ${isComboMode ? 'border-broker-cyan shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(130,234,255,0.1)]' : 'border-white/10'}`}
                            >
                             {sortedMarketTypes.map(m => (
                               <option key={m} value={m} className="bg-[#1A1A1C]">
                                 {t[m as keyof typeof t] || m.toUpperCase()}
                               </option>
                             ))}
                           </select>
                        </div>

                        {!isComboMode ? (
